                            <ul class="point-list">
                                <li><i class="bi bi-check2"></i><span>Clean, uncluttered task lanes.</span></li>
                                <li><i class="bi bi-check2"></i><span>A quick unarchive option whenever you need the reference.</span></li>
                            </ul>
                        </div>
                        <div class="panel-visual" style="align-items:center;">
                            <div style="width:56px; height:56px; border-radius:50%; background:var(--surface); border:1px solid var(--border); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; color:var(--brand); font-size:1.4rem; margin-bottom:10px;">
